@startuml
left to right direction

actor Librarian
actor Member

usecase "Search catalog" as UC1
usecase "Record loan for available book" as UC2
usecase "Authenticate user" as UC3
usecase "Reject unauthenticated loan request" as UC4

Member --> UC1
Librarian --> UC1
Librarian --> UC2
UC2 ..> UC3 : include
UC4 ..> UC2 : extend
@enduml
